-     entry .swap   `ints.swap(ordinal, n)`: stores to a slot of an `Atomic.Ints` and returns the value displaced
-     entry .replace   `ints.replace(ordinal, expected, updated)`: compare-and-set on a slot of an `Atomic.Ints`
