+   refer rudiments.Termination

-   entry .apply   `Exit(status)`: `Ok` for zero, `Fail(status)` otherwise
-   entry #exit   the exit itself, as its `Termination`
-   entry #apply   the status as an `Int`: 0 for `Ok`
-   entry #terminate   exits the JVM with this status, never returning
