- entry .adjacent   visits every overlapping adjacent pair: the boundary-window shape
-     `xs.adjacent { (left, right) => … }` passes `(xs(0), xs(1))`, `(xs(1), xs(2))`, … in order;
-     four elements give three pairs where `pairs` gives two, and fewer than two elements yield
-     nothing. Shipping in the `concordance` library; not exported to the umbrella.
+ entry .adjacent   visita cada par adyacente solapado: la forma de ventana de frontera
+     `xs.adjacent { (left, right) => … }` pasa `(xs(0), xs(1))`, `(xs(1), xs(2))`, … en orden;
+     cuatro elementos dan tres pares donde `pairs` da dos, y menos de dos elementos no producen
+     nada. Se distribuye en la biblioteca `concordance`; no se exporta al paraguas.

